{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjJjGamyTNQbzLWsLunJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JWDsPH33nLko5TGSMz8ZQ8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd .. && cat >> notes/decisions.md <<'E'\n- Sets are hand-composed from engine primitives in `[[object]]` entries (rounded boxes, cylinders, spheres, capsules) written by tools/gen_sets.py, rather than one JSON prop per item: the sets stay readable and hot-reload from disk. New prop JSON can still be dropped into engine/assets/props/lib/core/.\n- Arrow keys walk/lean and move menus; Q/E are the steps (the plan's \"Q or Left\" would make Left both a lean and a step in Floatie Spin and Morning Lap).\n- Step Party's lead-in is four beats (2.5 s) so the chart lines up with the song's beat grid; chart notes are stored in beats.\n- Real days: the page passes `today` (days since 1970); the sim never reads the clock.\n- The Long Stillness reads any button press (or any key through InputFrame.any) as forfeiting the Inner Peace bonus.\n- Hub ghosts are drawn by the app (not the sim), so the sim stays deterministic; Yesterday You and Play Together ghosts are NPC figures driven by the sim.\nE\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'E'\n- pav_audio: fit.rs (41 sfx, 8 gibberish voices, 6 songs), buses, sequencer, song clock. pav_app: fit_input.rs, weblink.rs, app.rs seams. web/index.html with hub block + about-data. hub/ files downloaded.\n- Web build works: `cd engine && scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene fit --title ... --out ../out/test.html` (12 MB). tests/browser.py written, running.\n- TODO next: browser test results; About pages from about-data; ghosts (Yesterday You, Together, hub); script.toml full length; Medley/hub test (tests/hub.py); audio tests; UI tests in pav_ui; feel pass with screenshots; README; tools/build.sh; exit-interview.json; final html in work/ root; delete engine/target.\nE\necho ok"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1201,"cache_read_input_tokens":471031,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1201},"output_tokens":54,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6bcbd63b-6fd6-450e-b613-afa8a801fe09","uuid":"63c4c714-2708-4b67-8216-77e70ba8dffa","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:27:26.396Z","request_id":"req_011CgjJjGGAraSGTkThFZTo6","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01JWDsPH33nLko5TGSMz8ZQ8":{"command":"cd .. && cat >> notes/decisions.md <<'E'\n- Sets are hand-composed from engine primitives in `[[object]]` entries (rounded boxes, cylinders, spheres, capsules) written by tools/gen_sets.py, rather than one JSON prop per item: the sets stay readable and hot-reload from disk. New prop JSON can still be dropped into engine/assets/props/lib/core/.\n- Arrow keys walk/lean and move menus; Q/E are the steps (the plan's \"Q or Left\" would make Left both a lean and a step in Floatie Spin and Morning Lap).\n- Step Party's lead-in is four beats (2.5 s) so the chart lines up with the song's beat grid; chart notes are stored in beats.\n- Real days: the page passes `today` (days since 1970); the sim never reads the clock.\n- The Long Stillness reads any button press (or any key through InputFrame.any) as forfeiting the Inner Peace bonus.\n- Hub ghosts are drawn by the app (not the sim), so the sim stays deterministic; Yesterday You and Play Together ghosts are NPC figures driven by the sim.\nE\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'E'\n- pav_audio: fit.rs (41 sfx, 8 gibberish voices, 6 songs), buses, sequencer, song clock. pav_app: fit_input.rs, weblink.rs, app.rs seams. web/index.html with hub block + about-data. hub/ files downloaded.\n- Web build works: `cd engine && scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene fit --title ... --out