{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjMaFAJGhEsvadQKVyNE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HVXP3Nt6SnpZb2PEPvsvN6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd .. && cat >> notes/feedback.md <<'E'\n- (critical) script.toml had a duplicate table after I extended it: the whole script silently loaded as empty, so the morning check never started and the playthrough test ran 60 sim-minutes without finishing. Found by the playthrough test; fixed, plus `talk()` never drops what follows a missing line, plus a content lint.\n- (minor) status `screen` leaked Rust Debug text (`Guests { new: true }`): browser test. Fixed with `Screen::name()`.\n- (moderate) A set change sets that room's own camera over a cue given on the same tick, so hub events kept the island camera: found in 1080p captures. Cues are now applied two ticks after the change.\n- (moderate) The dive camera sat inside the tower (yaw 90 from the plan on my layout): capture. Moved the camera to the board's side axis.\n- (minor) Single-file pack script needs a manifest link in index.html: build error. Added.\n- (minor) Test bugs of mine (double confirm in the Play Together test, a tip test that could not tip) cost two runs; not counted as game issues.\n- Count so far: 12 issues, 1 critical.\nE\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'E'\n- Tests: tests/run.sh core (17 tests, playthrough + event stars etc.), pav_audio tests (5), pav_ui tests (2), tests/browser.py (21 checks), tests/hub.py (11 checks) — all passing at last run (browser one flaky on timing).\n- Done since: ghosts (Yesterday You/Together/hub), About pages from about-data, dev viewers, click-to-walk, turntable, crowd figures, BigSplash/Wake in pav_view, story script (Pip 100+ lines), set cameras deferred.\n- Remaining: final build + rerun all tests, 1080p look at sets/screens, exit-interview.json, tools/build.sh to root html, README done, notes, delete engine/target, chat reply with Source/Testing/Engine/Prompt feedback.\nE\necho ok"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_read_input_tokens":613348,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":397},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6bcbd63b-6fd6-450e-b613-afa8a801fe09","uuid":"f0e6b52d-8cf3-4033-a435-3f2b6dc3302c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:04:44.837Z","request_id":"req_011CgjMaErhBfeNaLGmaFfb3","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01HVXP3Nt6SnpZb2PEPvsvN6":{"command":"cd .. && cat >> notes/feedback.md <<'E'\n- (critical) script.toml had a duplicate table after I extended it: the whole script silently loaded as empty, so the morning check never started and the playthrough test ran 60 sim-minutes without finishing. Found by the playthrough test; fixed, plus `talk()` never drops what follows a missing line, plus a content lint.\n- (minor) status `screen` leaked Rust Debug text (`Guests { new: true }`): browser test. Fixed with `Screen::name()`.\n- (moderate) A set change sets that room's own camera over a cue given on the same tick, so hub events kept the island camera: found in 1080p captures. Cues are now applied two ticks after the change.\n- (moderate) The dive camera sat inside the tower (yaw 90 from the plan on my layout): capture. Moved the camera to the board's side axis.\n- (minor) Single-file pack script needs a manifest link in index.html: build error. Added.\n- (minor) Test bugs of mine (double confirm in the Play Together test, a tip test that could not tip) cost two runs; not counted as game issues.\n- Count so far: 12 issues, 1 critical.\nE\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'E'\n- Tests: tests/run.sh core (17 tests, playthrough + event stars etc.), pav_audio tests (5), pav_ui tests (2), tests/browser.py (21 checks), tests/hub.py (11 checks) — all passing at last run (browser one flaky on timing).\n- Done since: ghosts (Yesterday You/Together/hub), About pages from about-data, dev viewers, click-to-walk, turntable, crowd figures, BigSplash/Wake in pav_view, story script (Pip 100+ lines), set cameras deferred.\n- Remaining: final build + rerun all tests, 1080p look at sets/screens, exit-interview.json, tools/build.sh to root html, README done, notes, delete engine/target, chat reply with Source/Testing/Engine/Prompt feedback.\nE\necho ok"}}}
