{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjR5VfL9mS4gqGPAkobF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The last round of fixes is in. The tests pass on the rebuilt page, and `engine/target` and other caches are deleted.\n\nThe Rust test counts are 17 core, 5 audio and 2 UI.\n\n**What changed this round:**\n- **Props:** I added 11 prop JSON files in `engine/assets/props/lib/core/`: palm, kettlebell, lotus, floatie ring, step box, exercise mat, flip-flop, smoothie glass, buoy, lounge chair and umbrella. The sets use the palm; the other ten are not placed in any set yet.\n- **Script:** the plan's line minimums are met. Pip has 102 lines, each coach has at least 25 once their event tips are counted, and Marjorie, Tom and the Twins now have 8 to 12 lines each.\n- **1080p check:** I captured the title, guest select, Tempo Squats, Step Party, Paddle Slalom, Cannonball Cup and the About screen at 1920×1080, and fixed the arrow glyph that drew as \"?\". The About capture showed the built-in fallback text, because the page's about-data block isn't loaded in that capture tool. I did not look at the About pages built from the real exit-interview text.\n- **Browser test timing:** the flaky checks (boot tick, held pad presses) now poll or hold longer instead of using short sleeps. This changed the tests, not the game.\n\n**Still not done:**\n- I captured only six of the nine sets at 1080p; the rest are unchecked at that size.\n- The \"feel pass\" was limited to the screenshot fixes and bot score tuning; no one has played it by hand.\n\nThe deliverables are `WiiFine-WiiFit-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-224025.html` and `exit-interview.json` in the root, with the dev folder beside them. The Source Information, Testing, Engine and Prompt feedback in my earlier reply still stands."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1078,"cache_read_input_tokens":654695,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1078},"output_tokens":635,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6bcbd63b-6fd6-450e-b613-afa8a801fe09","uuid":"d9bd2b08-2aba-4565-bda4-afd930577af0","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:50:40.142Z","request_id":"req_011CgjR5VBp4wTZ4ZDGmPATo"}
