{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjRk1orwUypupQhqsRP3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked all nine sets at 1080p, rendered the About screen from the real exit-interview text, and placed the props in the sets. The final `WiiFine-WiiFit-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-224025.html` and `exit-interview.json` sit in the root with the dev folder beside them. The browser suite passes 21/21 on this build. The Rust (core, audio, UI) and hub suites were last run before these set and prop changes.\n\n- **Sets:** I captured studio, gazebo, boardwalk, tide, channel, pier, tower, bay and the hub island at 1920×1080 and viewed them together. Compositions read correctly, with the figure framed, the crowd on rafts, the Puck clear of the action, and the chase and side cameras behind or beside the figure. The earlier camera, cue-order and Puck fixes show in these shots.\n- **Props:** all eleven new prop files are now placed in at least one set. They are the palm, lotus, kettlebell, floatie ring, step box, exercise mat, flip-flop, smoothie glass, buoy, lounge chair and umbrella.\n- **About screen:** I opened it in the built page by keyboard and viewed page 10 of 19, \"Testing Feedback 4/4\". It shows the real answer text, wrapped on the card, with the keyboard prompts.\n- **Browser tests:** my earlier edit was a timing fix to the tests, not a change to the game. The checks now wait for the game's tick or screen state instead of fixed sleeps. 21/21 pass on this build.\n- **Feel pass:** this was limited to the 1080p set captures, the screenshot fixes and bot score tuning. Nobody has played it by hand, and I can't do that here. The pad, touch and audio checks use stand-ins.\n\nI deleted the build caches."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":317,"cache_read_input_tokens":669700,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_