{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjUChS4HkVqw5DVticB8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`tests/run.sh all` finished with **62 passed, 0 failed** on the rebuilt page, with nothing edited after the page was built. That covers the Rust core, audio and UI tests, the browser checks, and the hub harness plus the solo check.\n\nThe first full run had one failure: in the 4-player, bad-network hub scenario, player 3's copy was too slow to report ready. It failed again on a re-run. The cause was that the ~60 guest figures were all created when the game first loaded. They now appear the first time each set is shown, and the hub scenario passes.\n\nI still can't hand-play the game here. The feel pass was scripted instead: bot and idle scoring across every event, the Balance Core feel tests, and 1080p captures of all nine sets. The pad, touch and audio checks use stand-ins, and nobody has heard the audio or used a real controller or phone.\n\nThe deliverables are in the root: `WiiFine-WiiFit-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-224025.html` and `exit-interview.json`, with the dev folder beside them. I deleted the build caches."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":279,"cache_read_input_tokens":674714,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":279},"output_tokens":362,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6bcbd63b-6fd6-450e-b613-afa8a801fe09","uuid":"b2577f5b-2ac1-444e-b6e1-4478d265bda1","timestamp":"2026-11-05T08:31:36.423Z","request_id":"req_011CgjUCgyWmsSY1mfMnCwqU"}
